@startuml
title SSAD — System Construction Workflow

start
:DISCOVER\nCollect evidence;
:BOUND\nDefine scope and boundary;
:OWN\nAssign responsibility and state ownership;
:MODEL\nBuild behavior, data, contract and component models;
:CONNECT\nCreate traceability and cross-references;
:SYNTHESIZE\nBuild cross-component views;
:VERIFY\nCross-check knowledge and evidence;

if (Material contradiction?) then (yes)
  :Reopen affected upstream knowledge;
else (no)
  :STABILIZE\nPromote maturity;
endif

stop
@enduml
